    "description": "ARTE documentary series \"contact sheets\" takes the pictures and working methods of the greatest photographers of the present under the microscope. In 33 individual portraits showing the DVD box the whole range of artistic photography: Henri Cartier-Bresson, the pioneer of modern photojournalism, combined to Sophie Calle, with its voyeuristic photo productions, to John Baldessari, who own and others' photographs of paintings and text . The DVD portrays a contact sheet Henri Cartier-Bresson, Helmut Newton, William Klein, Raymond Depardon, Mario Giacomelli, Josef Koudelka, Edouard Boubat, Elliott Erwitt, Marc Riboud, Leonard Freed, Don McCullin and Robert Doisneau.",
